# Input

```svelte
{#each items as item}
    <b>{item.name}</b>{#if item.isNew}*{/if}{#if item.isUpdated}!{/if}
{/each}

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,3 +1,9 @@
 {#each items as item}
-    <b>{item.name}</b>{#if item.isNew}*{/if}{#if item.isUpdated}!{/if}
+    <b>{item.name}</b>
+    {#if item.isNew}
+        *
+    {/if}
+    {#if item.isUpdated}
+        !
+    {/if}
 {/each}
```

# Output

```svelte
{#each items as item}
    <b>{item.name}</b>
    {#if item.isNew}
        *
    {/if}
    {#if item.isUpdated}
        !
    {/if}
{/each}
```
